NAME="News reader"
DESC="NewsFlash reads nyhet'r, the household news server on servr.no, and follows the light and dark theme. Opens on Super+W. Needs the home network or the Tind-VPN, and an account on the server (needs internet)"
STATUS="ready"
SCRIPT="/usr/lib/tind/setup-feeds"
# APPS: one line per app the user can tick: id|name|about|check (Tind Apps, 10 Nov 2026).
#   The ids are the ones the box script takes (pick_apps); check: space-separated alternatives, any one is enough;
#   kind:pkg+pkg needs all of them; kinds apt, flatpak, and apt? (the app is hidden when this Debian release has none).
APPS="
newsflash|NewsFlash|Feed reader for nyhet'r: pick FreshRSS and log in at https://nyhetr.servr.no/api/greader.php. Unsubscribing a feed deletes its starred articles: mute it on the server's web page instead|flatpak:io.gitlab.news_flash.NewsFlash
"
